# 5. Missing-Value and Coverage Investigation

Missing rent values were not automatically deleted.

A null rent observation can indicate that CMHC did not publish an estimate for a particular municipality, bedroom type, or period.

Treating these values as zero would create false rental prices and severely distort affordability calculations.

A coverage audit was therefore created for:

```text
Studio
1 Bedroom
2 Bedroom
3 Bedroom
Total
```

