# 17. CMHC Reliability Flags

The source contains reliability codes:

```text
a
b
c
d
```

The CMHC Rental Market Survey methodology identifies these as statistical reliability classifications for estimates.

For averages and totals:

| Flag | Reliability             |
| ---- | ----------------------- |
| A    | Excellent               |
| B    | Very good               |
| C    | Good                    |
| D    | Poor — use with caution |

CMHC indicates that estimates exceeding its publication reliability threshold may be suppressed rather than published.

The project therefore retains all published A–D observations.

D-rated observations are not automatically deleted; instead, they remain available for analysis with a visible caution classification.

