### Field Definitions

| Field              | Purpose                                                |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `csd_code`         | Stable Census Subdivision geographic identifier        |
| `municipality`     | Readable municipality name                             |
| `region`           | Durham, York, Toronto, Peel, or Halton                 |
| `year`             | CMHC reference year                                    |
| `survey_month`     | Survey month, currently October                        |
| `bedroom_type`     | Studio, 1 Bedroom, 2 Bedroom, 3 Bedroom, or Total      |
