# 27. Primary Rent Source Decision

Based on the validation work, the historical municipality tables were selected as the project's primary CMHC rent source.

The source strategy is therefore:

```text
rent_history_*
        ↓
Primary analytical source
        ↓
rent_clean
```

while:

```text
