As the project progresses, the clean BigQuery layer is expected to develop into:

```text
cleaned_cmhc
│
├── municipality_reference
├── rent_clean
├── vacancy_clean
├── income_clean
├── shelter_affordability_clean
└── inflation_clean
```

These clean fact and reference tables will later support analytical SQL views for:

```text
Rent-to-Income Ratio

Income Required to Afford a 2BR

Renter Households Spending 30%+

Vacancy Rate

Rent Growth vs. Income Growth
```

Power BI will connect to the analytical layer rather than directly performing transformations against the raw source tables.

